# --- Additional essentials ---
# software-properties-common removed from Trixie (Debian bug #1038747);
# add-apt-repository is no longer shipped. Our repos are configured via
# bright-repo (sources.list drop-ins) which doesn't depend on it.
desktop-file-utils
shared-mime-info
